Section: 2.2.2 Bootstrapping Procedure
Text: As shown in Figure 4, the Bootstrapped Data Balancer then randomly selects a balanced subset of the newly classiﬁed posts to maintain the same proportion of FACTUAL vs. FEELING documents throughout the bootstrapping process. These new documents are added to the set of labeled docu- ments, and the bootstrapping process repeats. We use the same threshold values to select new high- precision patterns for all iterations.

